"""One-use local coordination bridge; no thread delivery or lease claim."""
from pathlib import Path
from datetime import datetime, timezone
import hashlib,json,os
root=Path('D:/Aenv/pro2')
base=root/'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001'
other=Path('D:/Aenv/pro3/runs/coordination')
assert other.is_dir() and not other.is_symlink()
names=[
 'resume-2026-09-28-001/full-gate-009/driver-failed.json',
 'resume-2026-09-28-001/full-gate-009/continuation-001-failed.json',
 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/ROOT_GUARD005_BEFORE_CONTEXT_EXPIRED_001.json',
 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/native-schema2-admission-closure-prep003/INDEPENDENT_NATIVE_CLOSURE_SOURCE_REVISION003_REVIEW_001.json',
 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/successor-candidate-raw-revision004/INDEPENDENT_RAW_REVISION004_SOURCE_REVIEW_001.json',
]
data={n:(root/n).read_bytes() for n in names}
sha=lambda b:hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()
short=lambda n:sha(data[n])[:8]
stamp=datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(timespec='microseconds')
failed=[json.loads(data[n]) for n in names[:2]]
assert failed[0]['exit_code']==failed[1]['exit_code']==1
assert failed[0]['accepted_before']==failed[1]['accepted_before']==1
assert failed[0]['result_sha256'] is failed[1]['result_sha256'] is None
text=f'''# Current executor and resource coordination request013

Recorded {stamp} by pro2 Root thread01a0f844-b0d8-79a0-89d7-a823ce1b8962.
Owner local/private interval ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z.

The two actual Gate009 failure receipts remain preserved: original
{failed[0]['utc']} ({short(names[0])}) and continuation001
{failed[1]['utc']} ({short(names[1])}); each accepted_before1, exit1,
result SHA null. As observed at09:37, controllerHEAD3f74 has two D178 source/test
changes. No gate success or full release-chain readiness follows. The shared
SESSION RAM/security/Docker/watcher assertions are actor claims, not Root cause
or ownership evidence. Root has launched neither Gate009 nor its continuation.

Earlier STOP/sole-executor requests004-012 remain without an observed immutable
acknowledgement. Please stop further canonical live apply/fullQA/newgate/commit/
release/native advancement, preserve all live and spent bytes, and reply with
executor ownership, currentHEAD/source/test pins and running one-use identities.
The owner has been asked which session should own live execution. This is an
ownership clarification while isolated source/test preparation continues; no
permission to discard, reset, amend, replay or kill another actor is granted.

Root Raw004 source/test review ({short(names[4])}) accepts only staged preparation:
two fixed intermediate releases EA9->597->3f74->future final, strict full742 direct
parents/grouped263 QA/canonical schema3/private361287/global395799/API12/seven roles.
All58 test functions/82 new planned invocations remain UNRUN. Native003 different
review ({short(names[3])}) accepts only source/test preparation, operationally
bindable false; actual16 paths/growth/eight full OS commands/serializer parity/
physical capture/whole-Job cleanup and all111 methods/298 planned subtests remain ahead.

Root metadata BEFORE capture passed independent metadata-only review. Its producer,
helper and retained parent are spent. Context expired09:47:39UTC before whole or
unit entry; expiry reconciliation ({short(names[2])}) preserves all17 downstream
roles absent. A distinct metadata002 SOURCE-only successor is being prepared and
reviewed without replay, retimestamp or TTL extension. Guard14 and metadata24
remain UNRUN; no operational/native attestation is claimed.

Pro3 ACK007 component25/heavy/windows-qualification scopes stay HELD. No resource
lease,120-second window or native quiet is granted here. Preserve applicable two
5GiB startup checks,4GiB active floor,aggregateJob/disk/cleanup limits and no-fit
scope. Independently coordinate any owned RAM holder or watcher; Root has not
stopped or attributed unrelated/security/owner processes. A resource sample is
not durable custody or quiet. Original Python-free native guards remain unchanged.

These Root and Pro3 local bridge copies claim NO thread delivery, STOP receipt,
sole-executor transfer, lease or quiet agreement. Native Codex thread tools were
again absent from callable tool metadata. Please use a distinct immutable reply.
Root handoff/checkpoint022 records precise scopes. Preserve science/twins/existing
epoch/history83/84/spent attempts/caps/reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/
no-push/no-replay/no-extraepoch. Monitor restoration remains a closeout obligation.
'''.encode('utf-8')
outputs=[base/'COORDINATION_CURRENT_EXECUTOR_FRESHNESS_HOLD_013.md',other/'PRO2_RESOURCE_RESPONSE_20261002_009.md']
for p in outputs: assert not p.exists(),str(p)
for n,b in data.items(): assert (root/n).read_bytes()==b
for p in outputs:
 with p.open('xb') as s: s.write(text);s.flush();os.fsync(s.fileno())
assert outputs[0].read_bytes()==outputs[1].read_bytes()==text
record=dict(schema_version=1,created_utc=stamp,author='/root',input_rows=[dict(path=n,bytes=len(b),sha256=sha(b)) for n,b in data.items()],outputs=[dict(path=str(p),bytes=len(text),sha256=sha(text)) for p in outputs],local_exact_bridge_only=True,thread_delivery_verified=False,sole_executor_ack=False,lease_or_quiet=False,processes_changed=False,live_execution_authorized=False)
with (base/'COORDINATION_CURRENT_EXECUTOR_OBSERVATION_013.json').open('xb') as s:s.write((json.dumps(record,indent=2,sort_keys=True)+'\n').encode());s.flush();os.fsync(s.fileno())
print(json.dumps(dict(bridge_sha256=sha(text),bridge_bytes=len(text),thread_delivery_verified=False)))
